            <div xml:id="m-a7438d0d-059a-46ca-a47a-57677e7ea181">
              <lg xml:id="m-814261fa-5928-4826-818e-41b97a077735">
                <l xml:id="m-0c901a78-7fc7-4d5b-8d50-7ec2bea18a10" facs="#m-461ed42c-a187-4ba6-be65-3442e032832e" label="text-like">At Matins (2nd Nocturn)</l><l xml:id="m-3c13ed66-67e8-4d54-92ca-121e1b447176" facs="#m-3a52e6b6-b0ea-479f-8e71-9b633c87f060" label="ambiguous">645</l><l xml:id="m-e5d29a2d-a7aa-4467-a684-1e0bf0682646" facs="#m-2de1feef-866f-428e-8cc4-39410c50bae0" label="lyrics-like">ro Chrístum Judaé-is trádi- dit. V. Mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-1e6e5a80-84af-49e1-950c-d5ab4466eabe" facs="#m-327292af-e627-473d-a9d7-c6052d26233a" label="ambiguous">me¬</l><l xml:id="m-f3d9602b-30b8-4f8b-ba2e-ab4bb961d70a" facs="#m-ca161600-fd85-4108-bea4-b47fcbac9085" label="lyrics-like">li-us fl-li é- rat, si ná-tus non fu¬</l><l xml:id="m-f8ba9abf-9078-4514-b620-0652b6a6a7f5" facs="#m-a355e45b-7ac6-4dd2-ac20-0e9f790fb4a2" label="ambiguous">Is- set.</l><l xml:id="m-3bce7b34-b26a-4254-b9fe-e437627b13d5" facs="#m-aaf1c662-4197-411b-a15c-ff914c05f0af" label="lyrics-like">Denariórum.</l><l xml:id="m-712c9a16-8627-487f-92e2-b1f470c8ba56" facs="#m-5603ee10-4149-4d7a-b188-4ff37a0d0bd5" label="ambiguous">LESSON VI</l><l xml:id="m-53499909-db9a-4a78-98d1-e519ce1a8e34" facs="#m-a26a1c49-cb67-4eeb-8a2f-df9b175c6691" label="lyrics-like">Uóniam vidi iniquitátem et suas ad pópulum non credéntem,</l><l xml:id="m-de384acd-6409-41da-9ce5-90f98a8494bd" facs="#m-f27bd59c-29ce-4ea8-b4dc-c627b2f767dc" label="lyrics-like">L contradictiónem in civitáte.</l><l xml:id="m-5d44a164-493e-48eb-92f8-39a5675c5f91" facs="#m-d8889ed0-5619-47c4-9110-73a55deacebb" label="lyrics-like">et contradicéntem. Si enim iu¬</l><l xml:id="m-1de9726f-19a4-482c-aa1a-6016dc05d8c8" facs="#m-5e2550ba-7387-4c51-8061-f85c2a5e6de4" label="lyrics-like">Atténde glóriam crucis ipsius.</l><l xml:id="m-55bfd96e-5405-4abe-86d4-b5be094bf128" facs="#m-353352b0-fb22-4cbc-8121-22b2a8fe1e5c" label="ambiguous">stus est, qui ex fide vivit:</l><l xml:id="m-ee8bc4f6-0039-45d0-b8a1-d696711469a8" facs="#m-0e71c8fc-f567-4de5-a140-184a19200504" label="ambiguous">Jam in fronte regum crux illa</l><l xml:id="m-20275c91-d6a9-4775-a01e-0e0c26f37ded" facs="#m-49e7b29b-d0aa-4a19-891e-780ac15dbd0d" label="lyrics-like">iníquus est, qui non habet fidem.</l><l xml:id="m-7417abad-e5d5-4011-b673-3b4962789aac" facs="#m-f9ad94bc-e0e9-40a1-b829-894fe6c53ce8" label="lyrics-like">fixa est, cui inimíci insultavé¬</l><l xml:id="m-7738c407-5a1d-4dd4-a674-43752766b1f3" facs="#m-5edd66d9-429d-49e5-ab58-2ac098abda98" label="lyrics-like">Quod ergo hic ait, iniquitátem:</l><l xml:id="m-a8ce0f1c-1dc2-46ce-9b22-bbbf45683375" facs="#m-ca3d8916-a2d5-4e4b-b4fa-af0798547c8c" label="lyrics-like">runt. Efféctus probávit virtú¬</l><l xml:id="m-124427d5-2e31-4942-a836-60808ab64fed" facs="#m-cde19c64-aaee-4860-a39a-bbc9f8bbca6d" label="lyrics-like">perfidiam intéllige. Vidébat erxo</l><l xml:id="m-78c09442-b214-4965-8704-bc578da4538a" facs="#m-def69c1f-3dc8-44a3-9245-5dbb2d236b50" label="lyrics-like">tem: dómuit orbem non ferro,</l><l xml:id="m-a0d3f5f1-ed8b-43dd-b163-48e14b1d705b" facs="#m-e3aa1cd9-fafa-452f-b5fb-c059dba7346d" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus in civitâte iniquitátem</l><l xml:id="m-6f547cd9-a834-46e6-a929-6fdfc943c72c" facs="#m-cdf2e8ec-35d9-4146-b73e-0988946c71b0" label="ambiguous">sed ligno. Lignum crucis contu¬</l><l xml:id="m-b54e325b-959e-407e-8b54-7be073b7096b" facs="#m-95a9d9ac-c586-416e-994a-2d780184d8b7" label="lyrics-like">et contradictiónem, et exten¬</l><l xml:id="m-63a37b54-5107-4b2a-9cbe-cc76e7b7d155" facs="#m-1c9f25a8-e278-452a-8f15-65382bce9975" label="lyrics-like">méliis dignum visum est inimi¬</l><l xml:id="m-78cf4e9f-2469-4c87-b7d4-3a670870274d" facs="#m-9db71f5d-915f-45c2-9959-7be8f796f742" label="lyrics-like">débat manus suas ad pópulum</l><l xml:id="m-888618f8-4b47-4d1c-9fbc-ac9f8a2a5602" facs="#m-4f83449c-558a-4f71-9d67-b4963fa49fc1" label="lyrics-like">non credéntem, et contradicén¬</l><l xml:id="m-5a1c64e3-6db2-41fa-8046-04d706b07e9f" facs="#m-e90817e5-1c19-491d-9077-05208138da34" label="ambiguous">cis, et ante ipsum lignum stantes</l><l xml:id="m-cac3b82e-7bc5-419e-9208-3180379beeb4" facs="#m-4e56162d-8bcd-47eb-80a9-fe2ff631cb87" label="lyrics-like">caput agitábant, et dicébant:</l><l xml:id="m-d66cde35-476c-4605-a752-492ee5a97668" facs="#m-afd8d60e-cf53-425c-86b0-4c941708005e" label="lyrics-like">tem: et tamen et ipsos exspé¬</l><l xml:id="m-70229d30-901b-4e42-a687-32e01f24f956" facs="#m-1a530b33-229e-4d77-b622-6e2eee5556c5" label="lyrics-like">si Filius Dei est, descéndat de</l><l xml:id="m-2b79d88d-1f1b-46fe-bdfb-6be73f7c51eb" facs="#m-2ec5bc4e-2617-45ea-944c-8be1aa8f1428" label="lyrics-like">lctans dicébat: Pater, ignósce</l><l xml:id="m-2da367ba-6864-4cdc-8da4-96b2ac1a1f5d" facs="#m-676b64eb-786f-4868-8112-7d05d3e0c4ee" label="lyrics-like">cruce. Extendébat ille manus illis, quia nésciunt quid fáciunt.</l><l xml:id="m-163538fb-62b2-47f6-9938-39445da93923" facs="#m-162602d1-d99b-4d33-a9cb-233f2d6e095b" label="ambiguous">Resp.6</l><l xml:id="m-8db5076e-57c6-443c-9b55-63a5aa3a6ec6" facs="#m-65d58eaa-0573-4575-8609-4ef8218fc28c" label="lyrics-like">is trádet me</l><l xml:id="m-f22cc3a0-2237-41c6-b282-3da855289903" facs="#m-8021baae-7e64-4ca5-b3b4-7e584130b52a" label="lyrics-like">ex discípu-lis mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-58125f70-f349-4289-8cdf-2c3eb5c12b63" facs="#m-049032cb-35a9-4c4b-a1c2-dc5d2cfe2a09" label="ambiguous">A-nus</l><l xml:id="m-dcc38587-6b3d-44cb-9213-836cb9d6929e" facs="#m-d8147644-26c2-4048-a50c-3c84724dd2ab" label="lyrics-like">hódi- e: Vae fl¬ 1</l><l xml:id="m-97d45afd-4692-4e84-90fc-90d0d6a4d55d" facs="#m-db582488-aab5-43bc-90b4-ad2c8e054909" label="lyrics-like">quem trá-dar</l><l xml:id="m-d2c9e430-32d3-4c7b-970a-046e7ee4101c" facs="#m-1380da5e-c7a5-46cd-a869-00c1871de5bd" label="ambiguous">per</l><l xml:id="m-8dd84cf5-5016-4e86-acb7-ee77958a9664" facs="#m-846ae597-af54-41df-a1a6-9ba978857614" label="lyrics-like">go: " Mé-li-us Il-li é-rat,</l><l xml:id="m-53be1df6-c6a8-4ec2-a366-29ed9722ed59" facs="#m-c2c71480-ab75-445f-ad6f-fb0a75f21522" label="lyrics-like">é¬</l><l xml:id="m-7bc7150c-85ed-4af0-bb2f-2121645dca60" facs="#m-0c25d752-131c-4275-b8a3-6117ac3ecdba" label="lyrics-like">si ná¬ tus non</l><l xml:id="m-de2661dc-908d-4a93-95db-df8ae5083673" facs="#m-43977b63-bc3b-426b-a54c-bb3a6af986be" label="lyrics-like">Is- set. V. Qui intíngit</l><l xml:id="m-f7757818-4517-472b-ae4e-cc7e624b28de" facs="#m-5abef818-0e68-4ff5-a514-6ceb5f58c474" label="lyrics-like">mécum mánum in</l><l xml:id="m-f0b471c5-ea7a-4e5f-b974-f6211b8e101f" facs="#m-886f2fc5-53db-46e6-97b4-04246a1ab56f" label="ambiguous">fu¬</l><l xml:id="m-dfe85452-06d2-4d1e-b80d-b43ec0140f1d" facs="#m-7398e8a0-977b-4bf5-8f28-fcf8fe346f24" label="lyrics-like">parópsi- de, hic me tradi-túrus est in mánus</l><l xml:id="m-7ab867c5-0c2e-46c6-b4a5-dce0cbdab322" facs="#m-5a7dd1db-ceb5-46be-ae88-5c59ac396406" label="ambiguous">pec-ca¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
